{"version":1,"content":"<p>Credent Wealth Management首席投資官愛迪生·拜齊卡周日晚間花了五個小時開Zoom會議，推演在上周大幅拋售後市場可能出現的走勢。他和團隊已經做好準備，應對AI股繼續暴跌的極端情景。但一件事完全超出預料：本輪AI行情的核心人物黃仁勳即將恢復英偉達行政總裁一職，而他的回歸將點燃一波猛烈反彈。就在六天前，英偉達董事會還向投資者通報，黃仁勳不會回歸。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587768.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T03:03:56.194114+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":188,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T02:54:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T02:57:14.843404+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T02:57:14.843404+00:00","content_hash":"f6c1f21f04bb898d9e554a19fb879bbee98c6f19b8fb31667925dbc64e75e399","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}